'' RUN: object lifetimes (audit F-08, F-09): a constructed temporary passed byref, a
'' function result passed byref, an array initialised from constructor calls, a local, and
'' a member read off a returned temporary -- each constructor and destructor exactly as
'' fbc runs them. Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/object-lifetime.bas -o tests/codegen/objectlifetime.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/objectlifetime.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: +1[1]-1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: +2[2]-2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: +a+b|-b-a
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: +5|-5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: +7*7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -7
